SHA-1s and root tree SHA-1), and both 59ae42d26516db9f8a5dd1869c2015a2d23553a6
(Tazo!, 2026-02-12) and cbb6bbc036d8a2727105820384276501f60b67e2 (doofus, 2026-06-18)
are signed by GitHub Inc.'s private HSM key AND descend directly from my 53 pre-v2.1
commits (a19521d65196..12d892f0fadb, Oct 2025 - Jan 2026) and Persom's V2 downgrade
(e7ea1ccb83, Oct 1, 2025), altering or backdating even 1 bit of my 53 commits
is mathematically impossible without forging GitHub Inc.'s RSA PGP key.

